  "notes": "A versatile word used for both physical location and figurative position. When used as a suru verb ({位置|いち}する), it means \"to be located at\" or \"to be situated.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {位置|いち}{情報|じょうほう} (location information)\n- {位置|いち}づけ (positioning, status)\n- {位置|いち}を{確認|かくにん}する (confirm the position)\n- {位置|いち}を{特定|とくてい}する (pinpoint the location)\n- 〜に{位置|いち}する (to be located at ~)",
